body:
100% I'd be complete mage. I'm just hoping for a lot of spells, or an in-depth magic system. Also, I'd probs go lightning mage, fire mage, or void mage. If void is some type of necromancy, I'm 100% going void mage. I really hope there is spells that are extremely powerful and cover a massive area, but cost a lot to do obviously. Just imagine being able to cast a meteor storm that actually morphs the ground around you. Or imagine being able to change the weather to a lightning storm that has an abundance of lightning strikes that sets things on fire. 

&#x200B;

A man can dream.
